# Mode B Chain Steps (STEP 1 / 2 / 3)

Mode B (`..chain`) only. Do not emit XML/STEP headings in Mode A. Do not change halt tokens. Surface = `06-surface-quality` (UI glob) · Testing = `07-testing-gate` (code glob). Scenario Banner = `00-core-fsm` (after `CHAIN_STEP` each STEP). Active Rules Report = `11` only when applied — else Banner only.

