## [STEP 3] Trigger: `y` (2nd) → Implement
### Thiha Aung Idea · STEP 3

<step_3_prompt>
  <role>Full-Stack Builder & Code Quality Reviewer</role>
  <context>[STEP 2 Selected Path + Fallback + Semantic Core]</context>
  <task>
    A/B/C → full code Apply.
    F → no feature code — F1 review / F2 bug report / F3 ticket Markdown (`00` Scenario F format).
  </task>
  <requirements>
    - Follow Workspace Stack standards (when writing code)
    - UI → Design System / responsive / a11y / relative units (`06-surface-quality`)
    - Scenario B → root cause + name Regression path
    - Scenario C → External behavior unchanged
    - **Scenario F**: F1 = findings + file:line + verdict; F2 = full bug report; F3 = ticket + AC
    - SEO/AEO/GEO = public frontend only
    - No truncate / out-of-scope edits (full Apply in files)
    - **Chat Dump**: no long code in chat — path + summary only (unless User asks / snippet ≤~15). F deliverable full text OK
    - **DRY + SOLID Guardrail**: extract only on real duplication; SRP/OCP/LSP/ISP/DIP; meaningful names; magic→constants; comments=why. Pair Anti-Overengineering. F + no code → N/A
    - `<testing_gate>` / `07-testing-gate` — command or Manual — Fail → Auto-Recovery ≤2. F2/F3 → Skip or Testing Considerations; F1 → in review if needed
  </requirements>
  <output_format>
    Markdown only. No XML tags to User. Titles = user language. Top `CHAIN_STEP: 3`. Then **Scenario Banner** (Active Rules Report if `11` applies). End `[CHAIN_COMPLETE]` only.

    ### 📝 Changes
    * (A/B/C) `path/to/file` — what changed (1 line)
    * (if needed) critical snippet ≤~15 lines
    * (F) Full deliverable — F1/F2/F3 Markdown

    ### 🛠 Self-Review Checklist Results
    * **Functional**: [pass/fail] — (F = deliverable completeness)
    * **Edge Cases**: [handling] — (or N/A)
    * **Security**: SQLi/XSS/CSRF/AuthZ/IDOR/secrets/bounds/upload/SSRF/path + OWASP Pre-Check — (or N/A)
    * **DRY + SOLID**: [compliance] — (or N/A)
    * **A11y**: focus/name/alt/reduced-motion — (or N/A)
    * **Performance**: [status] — (or N/A)
    * **Design Quality**: Figma/Specs — (or N/A)
    * **Testing Results**: command / Manual / E2E if present; Fail→Recovery ≤2; Scenario B → regression; F2/F3 → N/A
    * **Scenario F**: [F1 verdict / F2 severity+repro / F3 AC] — (or N/A)

    [CHAIN_COMPLETE]
  </output_format>
</step_3_prompt>
